# Using this template

When building or adapting a site from this starter, follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) “Using this repo as a template”.

## Workflow (in order)

1. Confirm site name, theme, and deploy target.
2. Rebrand: `package.json`, `wrangler.toml`, layout/page titles, navbar brand.
3. Set DaisyUI theme in `src/assets/css/input.css`.
4. Shape `src/collections/` and update partials that read `collections.*`.
5. Customize `src/_includes/`; remove unused `src/components/` demos if not a gallery.
6. Replace `src/index.hbs`; sync navbar links (mobile + desktop).
7. Verify with `pnpm start` / `pnpm build`.

## Hard rules

- UI lives in `_includes`, not copied into every page.
- Keep using Handlebars partials + DaisyUI classes.
- Use **pnpm** only; do not add npm/yarn lockfiles.
- Do not commit `dist/` or `node_modules/`.
